ropic/llm.py](../../../src/sqllens/agent/integrations/anthropic/llm.py)) builds `a"}, {"file": "docs/internal/mcp-server/transport.md", "line": 118, "text": "Not yet covered: the memory-administration tools in `server.py` (`list_memories`, `add_memories`, `export_memories` and the rest) still call the synchronous Chr"}, {"file": "docs/internal/mcp-server/transport.md", "line": 120, "text": "Regression coverage: `tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py` holds a `query_database` model call open against a local stand-in for the Message"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 6, "text": "An MCP client may call ``list_data_sources`` before each question, and a"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 7, "text": "container health check polls ``/healthz`` every few seconds. Both are cheap,"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 9, "text": "agent's model call blocks that loop, every other request waits until the"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 51, "text": "\"stop_sequence\": None,"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 57, "text": "start = {**_MESSAGE, \"content\": [], \"stop_reason\": None}"}, {"file": "tests/integration/test_slow_agent_run_responsiveness.py", "line": 65, "text": "{\"type\": \"message_delta\", \"delta\": {\"stop_reason\": \"end_turn\", \"stop_sequence\": None},"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_opus_history.py", "line": 55, "text": "for block in final.content:"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_opus_history.py", "line": 56, "text": "if block.type == \"text\":"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_opus_history.py", "line": 60, "text": "def __init__(self) -> None:"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_opus_history.py", "line": 66, "text": "async def __aexit__(self, *args: object) -> None:"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_sql_runner_event_loop.py", "line": 6, "text": "The database drivers (``sqlite3``, PyMySQL, psycopg2) are synchronous. Each"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_sql_runner_event_loop.py", "line": 8, "text": "would freeze every other request the server handles until the query returned."}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_sql_runner_event_loop.py", "line": 9, "text": "These tests make the driver deliberately slow and count how often a concurrent"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_sql_runner_event_loop.py", "line": 37, "text": "async def heartbeat() -> None:"}, {"file": "tests/unit/test_sql_runner_event_loop.py", "line": 60, "text": ") -> None:"}], "audit_hints_truncated": false, "views": {"head": {"dir": ".prflow/tmp/review/pr-300/41095853767-1/view-head", "revision": "8be8c31db67e6decb8f2f73a097ce6624dd6f068"}, "base": {"dir": ".prflow/tmp/review/pr-300/41095853767-1/view-base", "revision": "e22cc02a43f7ebd3ee8984c05e2926d6bba6e791"}}, "pr": {"number": "300", "body": ".prflow/tmp/review/pr-300/41095853767-1/pr-body.md", "head_ref": "fix/issue-299-unblock-event-loop", "base_ref": "main", "api_head_sha": "8be8c31db67e6decb8f2f73a097ce6624dd6f068", "author_trust": "not-looked-up"}, "issue": {"number": "299", "source": "pr-body", "context": ".prflow/tmp/review/pr-300/41095853767-1/issue-context.md"}, "warnings": []}
